  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.1": "Tena samayena buddho bhagavā Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati Jetavane Anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.2": "tena kho pana samayena upāsakā bhikkhunīsaṃghassa cīvaratthāya chandakaṃ saṃharitvā aññatarassa pāvārikassa ghare parikkhāraṃ nikkhipitvā bhikkhuniyo upasaṃkamitvā etad avocuṃ: ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.3": "amukassa ayye pāvārikassa ghare cīvaratthāya parikkhāro nikkhitto. tato cīvaraṃ āharāpetvā bhājethā 'ti. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.4": "bhikkhuniyo tena ca parikkhārena sayam pi yācitvā bhesajjaṃ cetāpetvā paribhuñjiṃsu. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.5": "upāsakā jānitvā ujjhāyanti khīyanti vipācenti: ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.6": "kathaṃ hi nāma bhikkhuniyo aññadatthikena parikkhārena aññuddisikena saṃghikena saṃyācikena aññaṃ cetāpessantīti --pa--. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.7": "saccaṃ kira bhikkhave bhikkhuniyo . . . cetāpentīti. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.8": "saccaṃ bhagavā. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.9": "vigarahi buddho bhagavā: kathaṃ ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.10": "hi nāma bhikkhave bhikkhuniyo . . . cetāpessanti. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.11": "n' etaṃ bhikkhave appasannānaṃ . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.12": "uddisantu: ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.13.0": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:1.13.1": "yā pana bhikkhunī aññadatthikena parikkhārena aññuddisikena saṃghikena saṃyācikena aññaṃ cetāpeyya, nissaggiyaṃ pācittiyan ti. ||1|| ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.0": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.1": "yā panā 'ti . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.2": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.3": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.4": "adhippetā bhikkhunīti. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.5": "aññadatthikena parikkhārena aññuddisikenā 'ti . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.6": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.7": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.8": "saṃghikenā 'ti . . . saṃyācikenā ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.9": "'ti ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.10": "sayaṃ yācitvā. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.11": "aññaṃ cetāpeyyā ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-np7:2.12": "'ti . . . ",
